Error [jet.MisplacedParameterSeparator]: `/` comes after `*` in this parameter list
  --> tests/ui/param_zone_misplaced.jet:1:48
    |
  1 | connect: fn(host: String, *, timeout: Int{30}, /, tls: Bool{true}) -> String { "{host}" }
    |                                                ^
 Why: The zones read left to right: positional-only, then either, then label-only
 Fix: Move `/` before `*`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0763
